<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept palladium imports down 42.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept palladium imports down 42.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's palladium imports in September were down 42.2 percent from a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry data released on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in kg):</p>
<p>		    Sept 96	Aug 96    Sept 95</p>
<p> Total	     4,150	 6,770	7,190</p>
<p> Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	    2,736	 4,628	5,098</p>
<p> South Africa	481	 1,284	1,083</p>
<p>Imports in the first nine months of 1996 were 59.08 tonnes, against 75.20 tonnes in the same period a year earlier. -- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
